OL,5,G1800 Canal Boat Diaries
OL,6,     FHigh Lane to Manchester: Fallen
OL,7,     Ftrees block Robbie's journey on
OL,8,     Fthe Peak Forest Canal. Later, he
OL,9,     Fmeets TV host Terry Christian,
OL,10,     Fwhose dad once worked a local
OL,11,     Fwaterway.
OL,12,G1900 Canal Boat Diaries
OL,13,     FManchester to Summit: Robbie
OL,14,     Fstruggles with grounding out, a
OL,15,     Ftangled prop and constant
OL,16,     Fchallenges on the Rochdale Canal -
OL,17,     Fknown as the 'Everest of Canals' -
OL,18,     Fto reach its highest point.
